{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00266",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.99,
      "end_seconds": 2.71,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "Hello. Right, let's get started."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.72,
      "end_seconds": 4.58,
      "duration_seconds": 0.86,
      "text": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.37,
      "end_seconds": 7.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.16,
      "text": "Did you find the place alright?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 7.99,
      "end_seconds": 13.32,
      "duration_seconds": 5.33,
      "text": "Yes, it was easy enough. The parking was the hard part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 14.1,
      "end_seconds": 16.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.2,
      "text": "What seems to be the problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 16.95,
      "end_seconds": 26.0,
      "duration_seconds": 9.05,
      "text": "Um, so... a fit last month. That's why I came. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 26.53,
      "end_seconds": 31.19,
      "duration_seconds": 4.66,
      "text": "How long have you had it? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 32.64,
      "end_seconds": 35.8,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "It's been three days, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 36.6,
      "end_seconds": 39.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "How would you describe it, mild, moderate, severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.1,
      "end_seconds": 44.8,
      "duration_seconds": 4.7,
      "text": "Maybe a seven out of ten on a bad day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 45.45,
      "end_seconds": 48.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.38,
      "text": "Is it constant, or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 50.41,
      "end_seconds": 52.59,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "It's, It's every other day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 53.19,
      "end_seconds": 55.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Any a bit of confusion afterwards as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.36,
      "end_seconds": 71.61,
      "duration_seconds": 15.25,
      "text": "Yeah, uh, I've had that since last night. As for bit of confusion afterwards, maybe a three out of ten on a bad day. Tiredness was there, you know, but it's gone away on its own."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.6,
      "end_seconds": 76.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.03,
      "text": "Have you had any fever, headache or weakness on one side?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.34,
      "end_seconds": 82.36,
      "duration_seconds": 5.02,
      "text": "No fever, headache or weakness on one side, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 83.66,
      "end_seconds": 100.62,
      "duration_seconds": 16.96,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 102.19,
      "end_seconds": 104.5,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 105.36,
      "end_seconds": 107.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Have you had any surgery before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 108.26,
      "end_seconds": 113.4,
      "duration_seconds": 5.14,
      "text": "Yes, I had my thyroid operated on, a long time ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.49,
      "end_seconds": 116.86,
      "duration_seconds": 2.37,
      "text": "One moment, I'm updating your notes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.37,
      "end_seconds": 132.89,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "That's saved, thanks for waiting. What medicines are you taking at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.91,
      "end_seconds": 138.18,
      "duration_seconds": 4.27,
      "text": "Yeah, I'm on sodium valproate, 500 milligrams, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 138.52,
      "end_seconds": 142.67,
      "duration_seconds": 4.15,
      "text": "Alright, I'll try to keep this as efficient as I can."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 143.43,
      "end_seconds": 145.58,
      "duration_seconds": 2.15,
      "text": "Thank you, I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 147.12,
      "end_seconds": 151.25,
      "duration_seconds": 4.13,
      "text": "So, anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 151.61,
      "end_seconds": 153.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.19,
      "text": "So, my mother has migraines."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 154.48,
      "end_seconds": 161.84,
      "duration_seconds": 7.36,
      "text": "Do you have any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 163.01,
      "end_seconds": 164.43,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "I have epilepsy."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.77,
      "end_seconds": 173.5,
      "duration_seconds": 7.73,
      "text": "Yes, I can see the epilepsy in your file as well. What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.99,
      "end_seconds": 177.57,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "Well, no, nothing I'm aware of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 178.91,
      "end_seconds": 182.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "Do you need me to explain anything as we go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 183.76,
      "end_seconds": 189.82,
      "duration_seconds": 6.06,
      "text": "Just tell me in plain language, please. I'm not good with the medical terms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.25,
      "end_seconds": 191.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.01,
      "text": "What about alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.49,
      "end_seconds": 196.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "A beer or two most evenings, to be honest."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 197.35,
      "end_seconds": 198.05,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Any smoking?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 198.74,
      "end_seconds": 202.07,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "No, I don't smoke and never have."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 203.34,
      "end_seconds": 205.51,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 216.14,
      "end_seconds": 217.58,
      "duration_seconds": 1.44,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.74,
      "end_seconds": 235.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 18, saturation 98 percent, pulse 86. And pressure 125 over 79."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 236.19,
      "end_seconds": 237.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.43,
      "text": "Is that okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 238.82,
      "end_seconds": 241.4,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.92,
      "end_seconds": 245.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Let me have a look at you now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.61,
      "end_seconds": 249.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.86,
      "end_seconds": 269.16,
      "duration_seconds": 2.3,
      "text": "You're alert and orientated, speech is clear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 271.95,
      "end_seconds": 296.76,
      "duration_seconds": 24.81,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Thanks for bearing with me. Now that I've had a look, I can put the whole picture together. Right, here's what I'm thinking. This looks most like breakthrough seizure on known epilepsy. That's my thinking for now, and it may change as we learn more. It could also be a provoked seizure from missed medication, so we'll keep that open."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 297.67,
      "end_seconds": 307.2,
      "duration_seconds": 9.53,
      "text": "Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had a fit last month for three days, and no weakness on one side or fever."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 309.96,
      "end_seconds": 311.5,
      "duration_seconds": 1.54,
      "text": "Yes, that's right."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 312.22,
      "end_seconds": 315.59,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "Let me just pull up your file for a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 316.18,
      "end_seconds": 316.88,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 328.9,
      "end_seconds": 335.62,
      "duration_seconds": 6.72,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. I'd like to arrange a blood level of the tablet for adherence check."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CLINICAL_STAFF",
      "start_seconds": 336.6,
      "end_seconds": 340.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.86,
      "text": "We have a slot Thursday at 9 am, if that works."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 344.43,
      "end_seconds": 346.26,
      "duration_seconds": 1.83,
      "text": "Okay, I'll be there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 348.65,
      "end_seconds": 373.66,
      "duration_seconds": 25.01,
      "text": "I'm going to order an EEG, for seizure. That will help us see what's going on underneath and decide the next step. No driving until we've reviewed you again, I'm sorry, but that's the rule. Try to keep a simple diary of when it happens and what you were doing, and bring it to the next visit. I'd like you to see the epilepsy clinic as well, and I'll write the referral."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 374.9,
      "end_seconds": 385.06,
      "duration_seconds": 10.16,
      "text": "If you have another seizure lasting more than five minutes, or you feel really unwell, please don't wait, come to the emergency department. Come back in four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 386.09,
      "end_seconds": 390.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.87,
      "text": "Okay, so sure, I'll make the appointment on the way out."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 391.3,
      "end_seconds": 398.72,
      "duration_seconds": 7.42,
      "text": "Just so I know I've explained it clearly, can you tell me the plan back in your own words?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 399.09,
      "end_seconds": 403.4,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "So, I come back in four weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 403.84,
      "end_seconds": 408.61,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Okay, I think we've covered it. Do you have any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 410.05,
      "end_seconds": 413.51,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Um, I appreciate your time, doctor."
    }
  ]
}